flowchart TB
  subgraph UI[建议：界面层]
    direction LR
    Forms[Offer 表单与草稿]
    Views[比较表与结果解释]
    ImportView[导入预览与诊断]
  end
  subgraph Application[建议：应用层]
    direction LR
    OfferUseCase[保存 恢复 删除 hooks]
    CompareUseCase[计算与比较用例]
    ImportUseCase[导入用例与冲突处理]
  end
  subgraph Core[建议：领域层 无 IO]
    direction LR
    Validate[共享校验与快照迁移]
    Context[显式政策与假设上下文]
    Engine[纯函数工资 缴费 税费 预测 评分]
  end
  subgraph Adapters[建议：基础设施适配器]
    direction LR
    Repository[Repository 与 IndexedDB]
    Catalog[政策目录与版本来源]
    Browser[文件 时间 UUID]
  end
  UI --> Application
  Application --> Core
  Application --> Adapters
